Every year, the biggest demoparty in the world Revision is held in Saarbrücken, Germany. The best way to experience this is to go there, but not everyone can do this. The second-best way is to view the stream with some like-minded people and remotely join the party this way.

This year we will host a “Revison Satellite” party at TkkrLab. We open the doors on Sunday 20 April from 18:00 till 01:00 (or later). Program of Revision can be found [here](https://2025.revision-party.net/events/timetable/).

Event program from Revision :

